@startuml SequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor "Користувач (Web UI / CLI)" as Client
participant "Search Server (Crow Router)" as Server
participant "OllamaClient (LLM)" as Ollama
participant "InvertedIndex (BM25)" as Index
database "Ollama Service (:11434)" as OllamaDaemon

== 1. Пошук за ключовими словами (UC1: POST /api/search, mode=keyword) ==

Client -> Server: POST /api/search {"query": "parallel computing", "mode": "keyword"}
activate Server
Server -> Index: search(["parallel", "computing"], limit=20)
activate Index
Index -> Index: shared_lock по шардах та розрахунок BM25
Index --> Server: std::vector<SearchResult>
deactivate Index
Server --> Client: 200 OK {"results": [...], "time_ms": 12}
deactivate Server

== 2. Розширений пошук та WebSocket-стрімінг (UC2, UC3: /ws/search) ==

Client -> Server: WS Connect & Send: {"query": "space telescope"}
activate Server

Server -> Ollama: expand_query("space telescope")
activate Ollama
Ollama -> OllamaDaemon: POST /api/generate (mutex queue)
activate OllamaDaemon
OllamaDaemon --> Ollama: {"response": "{\"keywords\": [\"astronomy\", \"hubble\", \"galaxy\"]}"}
deactivate OllamaDaemon
Ollama --> Server: QueryExpansionResult (terms: [space, telescope, astronomy, hubble, galaxy])
deactivate Ollama

Server -> Client: WS Message 1: {"stage": "query_expansion", "data": {"expanded_terms": [...]}}

Server -> Index: search(expanded_terms, limit=20)
activate Index
Index -> Index: Паралельний розрахунок BM25 по шардах
Index --> Server: std::vector<SearchResult> (sorted by score)
deactivate Index

Server -> Client: WS Message 2: {"stage": "keyword_search", "data": {"results": [...], "time_ms": 12}}
Server -> Client: WS Message 3: {"stage": "done"}
deactivate Server

== 3. Паралельна побудова індексу (UC4: POST /api/index) ==

Client -> Server: POST /api/index {"threads": 8}
activate Server
Server -> Server: lock(index_build_mutex_) -> ThreadPool(8)
loop Для кожного пакета текстових файлів
    Server -> Index: count_tokens(), register_document(), add_document_terms()
end
Server --> Client: {"status": "ok", "documents_indexed": 10410, "time_ms": 710}
deactivate Server

== 4. Моніторинг стану та статистики (UC5, UC6) ==

Client -> Server: GET /api/health
activate Server
Server -> OllamaDaemon: GET /api/tags
OllamaDaemon --> Server: 200 OK
Server --> Client: {"status": "ok", "ollama": true}
deactivate Server

Client -> Server: GET /api/stats
Server --> Client: {"documents": 10410, "index_build_time_ms": 710, "threads_used": 8}

== 5. Дослідження масштабованості (UC7: benchmark.py) ==

Client -> Server: Цикл POST /api/index {"threads": p} (p = 1..16)
Server --> Client: Час побудови T(p)
Client -> Server: Паралельні POST /api/search від N клієнтів (N = 1..50)
Server --> Client: Пропускна здатність Throughput (req/s)
@enduml
